    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50779" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vexābĭlis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		vexo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Disturbed</i>, <i>plagued</i>, <i>vexed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">membra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lact. 7, 5, 10</span></i>
			 Bünem. <i>N.
			cr.</i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Causing annoyance</i>, <i>troublesome</i>, <i>vexatious</i>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 1, 11, 78</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 9, 39</span></i>.</div>
